				<textElement textAlignment="Left">
					<font size="11" isBold="true"/>
					<paragraph leftIndent="5"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[NOTE: 
1. THE TERM “SERIES OF CASH TRANSACTIONS” REFERRED TO IN TABLE 16.E IS SOLELY FOR THE PURPOSES OF COLLECTING STATISTICAL INFORMATION FOR THE RBS.  ACCORDINGLY, SIMILAR WORDS OR TERMS USED IN THE GUIDANCE NOTES ON AML/CFT ISSUED BY THE NBDTI OR IN ANY OTHER LEGISLATION SHOULD NOT BE CONSTRUED AS HAVING THE SAME MEANING.
2.  If the deposit or withdrawal on any day is counted in a series, it SHOULD NOT be counted again in another series.

"												

]]></text>
			</staticText>
